 @richardnpaul_mob  Yeah, exactly. They’re still £599 today! (Same as 9070). Some days there are discounts but it seems that GPUs are now far more stable ‘assets’. For example, the 7900xt won’t stop being £599 just because the 9070 came out. It’s like they’re trying to slot in products in-between the gaps of a generation rather than outright replacing them. 

